# Worker 镜像运行时契约：tcsd-runtime 的 support-package 资源由
# bundle-manifest.json 登记（就地校验门），必须进入构建上下文。
# 排除规则先匹配后，此处按顺序反向放行，保持「最后匹配生效」。
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/**
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/support-package/
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/support-package/**
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/support-package/**/*.slx
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/support-package/**/*.mat
!skills/hermes/tcsd-runtime/assets/support-package/**/*.sldd
